# Build context for the PARALLAX image -- Kuberns builds this, and so does a
# local "docker compose build".
#
# This file is a security boundary, not just a size optimisation.  The image is
# built with "COPY . .", so every file not listed here is baked into a layer that
# anyone who can pull the image can read.  A naive checkout of this repository
# contains a live .env, a Dhan access token, a SQLite journal and a 900 MB
# research cache directory.
#
# Matching notes (Docker/moby semantics): a pattern is matched against the path
# relative to this file, component by component, and a single-segment pattern
# such as "research" therefore excludes ONLY ./research.  That matters here --
# parallax/apps/research/ is a required Python package (the workers import
# parallax.apps.research.ict_backtest) and must survive.  The leading "/" below
# states that root-relative intent explicitly.

# --------------------------------------------------------------- secrets ----
# Live credentials and broker session state.  Never ship, never commit.
.env
.env.*
.dhan_token*
.dhan_token_generated
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------- local state ----
parallax.db
parallax.db-*
*.db-journal
options_hold*.json
*.log

# -------------------------------------------------------------- scratch ----
# Ad-hoc root-level scripts (_*.py is already gitignored).
_*.py
_*.sh
_*.txt
_*.out
_*.json
# ...but __init__.py starts with "_" too, and the package needs it.
!**/__init__.py

# --------------------------------- large caches that are not runtime deps ----
# 900 MB of walk-forward artefacts (features.npz, daily_panel.parquet, bars/).
# Not imported at runtime: the workers import the *package*
# parallax/apps/research/, which is untouched by this rule.
/research/
# 25 MB Dhan scrip master.  Re-downloaded on demand by
# parallax.adapters.broker.dhan.ensure_scrip_master() -- see deploy/kuberns.md
# for the cold-start cost this implies.
/data/
# Backtest caches living inside the package.  The .py modules stay; only the
# leading-underscore pickle caches go.
**/_ladder_*.pkl
**/_signals*.pkl

# --------------------------------------------------- VCS and build tooling ----
/.git/
/.github/
/k8s/
/deploy/
/tests/
/.kuberns_docs/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
Procfile
README.md

# ----------------------------------------------------------------- python ----
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
/.venv/
/venv/
/env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
